#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduccion"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kiriki; is a dice game for &kde;. It is a clone of Yahtzee."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It features from two to six players (human or artificial intelligence "
"driven)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Règlas"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game is played in turns. Each turn the player gets 3 rolls of dices, "
"that is, the initial roll plus two additional rolls. Before each additional "
"roll the player can select which dices to roll again by clicking on them. "
"Clicking the Roll button will roll the selected dices."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once the three rolls have been exhausted or when the player decides his "
"dices are good enough, the player has to assign his dices to one of the "
"fields. This is done by clicking on the row and column of the desired field."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are fourteen different fields, the score for each is calculated as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "1s: The number of dices with 1."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "2s: 2 * The number of dices with 2."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "3s: 3 * The number of dices with 3."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "4s: 4 * The number of dices with 4."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "5s: 5 * The number of dices with 5."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "6s: 6 * The number of dices with 6."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bonus if > 62: 35 points if the previous fields sum more than 62."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "3 of a Kind: Sum of the dices if there are three dices with the same value."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "4 of a Kind: Sum of the dices if there are four dices with the same value."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Full House: 25 points if there are three dices with the same value and two "
"with the same value (different from the other)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Small Straight: 30 points if there are four dices with consecutive values."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Large Straight: 40 points if there are five dices with consecutive values."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kiriki: 50 points and a additional turn if there are five dices with the "
"same value."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Chance: The sum of the dices' values."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When all players have exhausted their turns, the game ends. The player with "
"the biggest score wins."
msgstr ""

